ted States Department of Homeland Security (DHS) released the following statement after U.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement’s (ICE) Homeland Security Investigations (HSI) arrested https://t.co/JYMAHgXR9t", "url": "https://x.com/thejohnettecruz/status/2115041161354076482"}, {"author_id": "1018524702757793792", "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:22:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114920618487398526"], "id": "2114920618487398526", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Action Bronson.. was magnificent tonight at LPR.\n@ActionBronson https://t.co/lNmCz3CShp", "url": "https://x.com/bypapijuan/status/2114920618487398526"}, {"author_id": "3229617158", "created_at": "2026-10-26T03:30:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114560238045258083"], "id": "2114560238045258083", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#Dow #djia takes a sharp dive as #oil prices rise with the orange bully threatening another round of strikes against #Iran.\n\n#economics #finance #business #manufacturing #transport #industries #Fed #IMF #IBRD #EBRD #BIS #AMRO #AIIB #ADB #NDB #PBOC #ISDB https://t.co/xP5uC4SPCC", "url": "https://x.com/IngeniumAdvisor/status/2114560238045258083"}, {"author_id": "1550079304540647424", "created_at": "2026-10-26T03:13:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114555933066228013"], "id": "2114555933066228013", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 355, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "PBOC Adjusts Yuan Reference Rate to 6.7162 Amid Key Global Central Bank Moves\nhttps://t.co/0M4p5Acyn6\n#PeopleSBankOfChina #ChineseYuan", "url": "https://x.com/trendkia/status/2114555933066228013"}, {"author_id": "2091084671765581824", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:07:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114826205044298235"], "id": "2114826205044298235", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Yuan hit a 4-year high: onshore USD/CNY 6.6682, best since Jun 2022, +4.87% YTD.\nBut the PBOC fix (6.7162) came in 471 pips weaker than Reuters' estimate. Barclays: Beijing is resisting faster gains.\nGoldman's 6.40 target implies ~4.2% more.\n#Yuan #PBOC #Forex https://t.co/nUL8qNUwWj", "url": "https://x.com/TradeProtop/status/2114826205044298235"}, {"author_id": "2046701861185437698", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:43:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114865571313627500"], "id": "2114865571313627500", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A normal endoscopy can miss silent reflux.\n\nAn EGD looks at your esophagus, stomach, and the start of your small intestine, and passes your voice box on the way down.\n\nFor throat symptoms, ask an LPR-informed ENT about a flexible laryngoscopy.\n\n#LPR #AcidReflux #Reflux", "url": "https://x.com/TheRefluxRD/status/2114865571313627500"}, {"author_id": "2044991600783417344", "created_at": "2026-10-26T02:38:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114547133348991305"], "id": "2114547133348991305", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China's yuan just hit 6.6682 per dollar — strongest since June 2022. The PBOC midpoint is at its firmest since Feb 2023 too.\n\nQuiet move, but it says a lot.", "url": "https://x.com/Jameso9vt/status/2114547133348991305"}, {"author_id": "2037455118124363776", "created_at": "2026-10-26T09:12:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114646229905035581"], "id": "2114646229905035581", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 415, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "PBOC剛剛推出了債市非銀大額贖回互換便利（Bond Market NBFI Swap Facility，簡稱BNSF），落落長一大堆。\n\n但在我看來，是PBOC要處理長債到期贖回+流動性危機+投資低迷的問題。\n\n表面上說是為了處理流動性風險，但更深層的原因大概是PBOC已經發現越來越多的高額長天期債券即將到期+藉此增加投資意願。", "url": "https://x.com/Vincentqt03/status/2114646229905035581"}, {"author_id": "2964262283", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:05:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114719973281058867"], "id": "2114719973281058867", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 86, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Useful guide to China's econ policy universe, by @joshxxiao \nAll about Politburo Standing Committee, Politburo, Central Committee, Commissions, State Council, National People's Congress, PBOC, Work Conferences\nhttps://t.co/WnNHm2klfZ, via @business", "url": "https://x.com/HowardJShatz/status/2114719973281058867"}, {"author_id": "1966937657063141376", "created_at": "2026-10-26T00:20:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114512352922243393"], "id": "2114512352922243393", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 166, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Estimate points to China PBOC setting yuan midpoint at 6.6691 per dollar", "url": "https://x.com/MarketsCapApp/status/2114512352922243393"}, {"author_id": "305427771", "created_at": "2026-10-26T11:27:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114680366263095647"], "id": "2114680366263095647", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "JUSTIN: China keeps its benchmark lending rates unchanged for the 17th consecutive month! The one-year LPR remains at 3.00%, and the five-year LPR at 3.50%.\n\n最新消息： 中国连续第17个月维持贷款市场报价利率不变！一年期LPR为3.00%，五年期LPR为3.50%。", "url": "https://x.com/wangh920/status/2114680366263095647"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1426871362606440453", "name": "🇺🇸退屈なので資産を増やすことにしました🇯🇵", "us